{"status":"ok","message-type":"work-list","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"facets":{},"total-results":47654,"items":[{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2025,12,14]],"date-time":"2025-12-14T16:14:05Z","timestamp":1765728845575},"reference-count":0,"publisher":"Universidad Autonoma Metropolitana","issue":"96","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["AE"],"DOI":"10.24275\/uam\/azc\/dcsh\/ae\/2022v37n96\/lopez","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2022,10,18]],"date-time":"2022-10-18T20:56:51Z","timestamp":1666126611000},"page":"99-117","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":1,"title":["Spillover effect and dynamic correlation between Bitcoin prices, oil, gold and stock market volatility"],"prefix":"10.24275","volume":"37","author":[{"given":"Jorge Alberto","family":"L\u00f3pez Villa","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"name":"Universidad Aut\u00f3noma Metropolitana-Iztapalapa","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Martha Beatriz","family":"Mota Arag\u00f3n","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]}],"member":"10370","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2022,9,1]]},"container-title":["An\u00e1lisis Econ\u00f3mico"],"original-title":["Derrame de volatilidad y correlaci\u00f3n din\u00e1mica entre el precio del Bitcoin, el petr\u00f3leo, el oro y la volatilidad del mercado de valores"],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2024,7,19]],"date-time":"2024-07-19T17:22:13Z","timestamp":1721409733000},"score":26.43016,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/analisiseconomico.azc.uam.mx\/index.php\/rae\/article\/view\/699\/540"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[2022,9,1]]},"references-count":0,"journal-issue":{"issue":"96","published-print":{"date-parts":[[2022,9,1]]}},"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.24275\/uam\/azc\/dcsh\/ae\/2022v37n96\/lopez","ISSN":["0185-3937"],"issn-type":[{"type":"print","value":"0185-3937"}],"published":{"date-parts":[[2022,9,1]]}},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,21]],"date-time":"2024-02-21T00:25:32Z","timestamp":1708475132870},"reference-count":0,"publisher":"Asociaci\u00f3n Cuadernos de Econom\u00eda","issue":"3","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["REyF"],"abstract":"<jats:p>En el contexto de creciente inter\u00e9s en los activos digitales y sus implicaciones para los mercados financieros, esta investigaci\u00f3n aborda la volatilidad tanto de activos financieros como digitales, en respuesta a cambios en la pol\u00edtica monetaria de los bancos centrales. Utilizando la componente tendencial del estimador de Garman y Klass y su correspondiente estandarizaci\u00f3n respecto al volumen de mercado, se detecta que la volatilidad de Bitcoin ha disminuido de forma gradual a medida que han cambiado las pol\u00edticas monetarias, consolidando el camino hacia un valor m\u00e1s descorrelacionado respeto otros activos. A diferencia de Bitcoin, otras criptomonedas analizadas mantuvieron un perfil de volatilidad similar a los activos financieros tradicionales. A pesar de la incertidumbre regulatoria, Bitcoin muestra una menor susceptibilidad a la volatilidad en comparaci\u00f3n con otras criptomonedas, lo que podr\u00eda interpretarse como un signo de su legitimidad y aceptaci\u00f3n en los mercados financieros. Adicionalmente, la investigaci\u00f3n examina el papel potencial de las monedas digitales emitidas por bancos centrales (CBDCs) en la legitimaci\u00f3n del espacio de moneda digital y su posible efecto sobre Bitcoin. Los resultados contribuyen a un mejor entendimiento de la naturaleza de los activos digitales y ofrecen una base argumental para futuras investigaciones.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.32826\/reyf.v1i3.346","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,20]],"date-time":"2024-02-20T15:40:13Z","timestamp":1708443613000},"source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["An\u00e1lisis de la volatilidad de bitcoin en comparaci\u00f3n con otros activos financieros"],"prefix":"10.32826","volume":"1","author":[{"given":"Dami\u00e0","family":"Rey Mir\u00f3","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"David","family":"Alvaro Berlanga","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Ricardo","family":"Palomo Zurdo","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]}],"member":"17910","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,20]]},"container-title":["Revista de Econom\u00eda y Finanzas"],"link":[{"URL":"https:\/\/reveyf.es\/index.php\/REyF\/article\/download\/346\/162","content-type":"application\/pdf","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"text-mining"},{"URL":"https:\/\/reveyf.es\/index.php\/REyF\/article\/download\/346\/162","content-type":"unspecified","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"similarity-checking"}],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,20]],"date-time":"2024-02-20T15:40:15Z","timestamp":1708443615000},"score":23.461521,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/reveyf.es\/index.php\/REyF\/article\/view\/346"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,20]]},"references-count":0,"journal-issue":{"issue":"3","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,20]]}},"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.32826\/reyf.v1i3.346","ISSN":["2952-3931","2952-3923"],"issn-type":[{"value":"2952-3931","type":"electronic"},{"value":"2952-3923","type":"print"}],"published":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,20]]}},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,1,31]],"date-time":"2026-01-31T05:11:35Z","timestamp":1769836295925,"version":"3.49.0"},"reference-count":0,"publisher":"Universidad Autonoma Metropolitana","issue":"106","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["AE"],"DOI":"10.24275\/uam\/azc\/dcsh\/ae\/2026v41n106\/urban","type":"journal-article","created